<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON UNFINISHED MATCHES.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON UNFINISHED MATCHES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unfinished women's singles first</p>
<p>round matches on Wednesday at the Wimbledon tennis tournament</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding)</p>
<p>9-Mary Pierce (France) leads Dominique Van Roost (Belgium)</p>
<p>1-0</p>
<p>Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) leads  Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 2-0</p>
<p>Judith Wiesner (Austria) level 1-1 with Jana Kandarr</p>
<p>(Germany)</p>
<p>Radka Zrubakova (Slovakia) leads Nancy Feber (Belgium) 1-0</p>
<p>Nana Miyagi (Japan) leads Nathalie Tauziat (France)  2-0</p>
<p>Corina Morariu (U.S.) level 1-1 with Claire Taylor (Britain)</p>
<p>Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) leads Natasha Zvereva (Belarus)</p>
<p>6-2 4-0</p>
<p>Lorna Woodroffe (Britain) level 1-1 with Patty Schnyder</p>
<p>(Switzerland)</p>
<p>Sarah Pitkowski (France) leads Francesca Lubiani (Italy) 1-0</p>
<p>Aleksandra Olsza (Poland) leads Lenka Nemeckova (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 1-0</p>
<p>Jolene Watanabe (U.S.) leads Magui Serna (Spain) 2-0</p>
<p>Els Callens (Belgium) leads Paola Suarez (Argentina) 1-0</p>
</text>
